    <panel_attributes>title=SD13 Plan a request and save one complete turn
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=AgentController~c
obj=MemoryManager~m
obj=AgentPlanner~p
obj=LLMClient~l
obj=MemoryRepository~r

u-&gt;f : runAgent(courseId, sessionId, request)
f-&gt;c : handleRequest(courseId, sessionId, request)
c-&gt;m : loadSession(courseId, sessionId)
m.&gt;c : full saved history
c-&gt;p : createPlan(courseId, request, history)
p-&gt;l : generate(executionPlanPrompt with last ten messages)
l.&gt;p : proposed JSON
p.&gt;c : ExecutionPlan or clarification
c: executePlan(courseId, plan) including validation
c-&gt;m : addTurn(request, actual final answer)
m-&gt;r : saveConversation(courseId, sessionId, both messages)
r.&gt;m : one temporary-file replacement or failure
c.&gt;f : AgentResult with actual output and trace
f.&gt;u : AgentResult
m:A failed turn save leaves old messages unchanged, AgentResult is FAILED but completed tools remain effective
u:CLI --json emits a FAILED result if saved conversation data cannot load</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
</diagram>